@stevekrouse I mention him because I ran across some clearly AI-generated (and undisclosed) text in the style of Pratchett a few months ago and found it deeply offensive to my core - it actually fooled me when I first skimmed it, I thought a person had put the work in and done an OK job
[->] @stevekrouse ... and then as I looked more carefully the lack of care and attention become more and more obvious

I'm trying to imagine a flawless AI version of this and I just can't get there, the humanity is a huge part of what make Pratchett's writing so good

